WEBVTT

00:08:56.912 --> 00:09:00.329
You know, what is the service
look like when anyone

00:09:00.329 --> 00:09:02.704
on Earth who wants really
great medical advice?

00:09:04.204 --> 00:09:07.579
Can get better medical advice than
any single doctor could ever get,

00:09:07.579 --> 00:09:12.162
because this has the total medical
knowledge and reasoning ability that

00:09:12.162 --> 00:09:14.371
the some humanity has ever produced.

00:09:15.371 --> 00:09:16.829
When you want to learn something,

00:09:16.829 --> 00:09:21.537
you have sort of a tutor that understands
your exact style,

00:09:21.537 --> 00:09:23.496
how you best learn everything you know,

00:09:23.787 --> 00:09:26.996
and custom teaches you whatever concept
you want to learn someday.

00:09:26.996 --> 00:09:28.204
You can imagine that like.

00:09:29.579 --> 00:09:33.746
You have an eye that reads your email
and your task list and your calendar